  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WYDE | Political Parties</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Identifying and contributing to remove barriers to youth meaningful participation in political parties and as candidates; Barriers of all forms: economic, political, logistical, social etc.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Encouraging young people involved in politics to embrace the democratic governance model and the rules of the electoral game; and better familiarize youth about how parties work specifically.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Helping young people involved in politics to promote social links of tolerance and peace between different communities in the same country;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bridging and accompanying regional efforts, by specialized institutions, especially Political Parties Regulatory Bodies, to increase political parties&#xbf; transparency, credibility, and attractiveness in the eyes of young people.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
